From: sss@dark-alexandr.net
Date: Sun, 9 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] ik-llama-f8-e4m3: add GGML_TYPE_F8_E4M3 (ID=43) support for per_layer_token_embd.weight

New ggml type FP8 E4M3 (OCP), 1 byte/element, with:
- type traits (blck_size=1, is_quantized=false)
- quantize/dequantize ref functions in iqk/
- ftype mapping, quantize_chunk dispatch, clamp switch
- GGML_TYPE_COUNT=400 to avoid GCC 15 designated-init error
- llama-quantize-ik.cpp for nix build

diff --git a/examples/quantize/llama-quantize-ik.cpp b/examples/quantize/llama-quantize-ik.cpp
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..19295029
--- /dev/null
